WEBVTT

NOTE en_md5 d39fabecd86df2df0d2b749f6d2241ba

00:00:00.260 --> 00:00:02.070
Karibu tena. Natumaini ulifurahia

00:00:02.120 --> 00:00:04.900
msururu ule wa mazoezi. Unapiga hatua nzuri

00:00:04.940 --> 00:00:07.970
sana. Hongera. Basi, video hii ni

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:10.740
fupi. Tayari unajua string ni nini.

00:00:10.940 --> 00:00:12.800
Ni vipande vya karatasi vilivyoandikwa

00:00:12.840 --> 00:00:15.440
maandishi. Umekuwa ukizitumia katika kozi yote

00:00:15.520 --> 00:00:18.960
hadi sasa. Lakini hadi kufikia hapa, kila string uliyotumia

00:00:19.100 --> 00:00:22.000
ni ile uliyoandika moja kwa moja. Nini

00:00:22.040 --> 00:00:24.620
hufanyika ikiwa unataka kuunda string

00:00:24.660 --> 00:00:28.500
kutokana na variable au masharti? Tunafanyaje

00:00:28.560 --> 00:00:31.200
hivyo? Sawa, kuna njia mbili

00:00:31.300 --> 00:00:34.520
nitakazokuonyesha. Ya kwanza

00:00:34.640 --> 00:00:38.370
inaitwa string concatenation (uunganishaji wa string), ambayo ni njia ya kifahari,

00:00:38.460 --> 00:00:41.600
na yenye kuchanganya kidogo, ya kusema kuunganisha string mbili

00:00:41.640 --> 00:00:46.120
pamoja. Fikiria una maneno mawili, hello na

00:00:46.160 --> 00:00:48.420
world (dunia), na unataka kuunda string

00:00:48.440 --> 00:00:51.730
iliyo na hello world. Unaweza tu kuandika

00:00:51.940 --> 00:00:54.460
hello world kama string moja, lakini unaweza

00:00:54.540 --> 00:00:59.570
pia kuandika "hello " + "world", na hiyo

00:00:59.600 --> 00:01:03.260
itakupa string ile ile. Sasa, kwa wazi,

00:01:03.340 --> 00:01:05.340
hilo halina matumizi makubwa katika hali hii.

00:01:05.940 --> 00:01:08.180
Lakini vipi ikiwa tuna variable yenye

00:01:08.240 --> 00:01:10.420
jina la mtu na tunataka

00:01:10.460 --> 00:01:12.780
kumsalimu? Kwa hiyo fikiria tuna

00:01:12.820 --> 00:01:16.020
variable inayoitwa name (jina), na wakati mwingine ina Jeremy

00:01:16.060 --> 00:01:18.860
na wakati mwingine ina Jiki. Tunataka kusema

00:01:18.920 --> 00:01:22.280
hello Jeremy au hello Jiki kwa kutumia variable hiyo.

00:01:23.380 --> 00:01:25.860
Sawa, tunaweza kufanikisha hili kwa kutumia uunganishaji

00:01:25.920 --> 00:01:30.600
huu, kwa kuandika "hello " + name, na hiyo

00:01:30.620 --> 00:01:33.480
itatupatia hello Jeremy au hello

00:01:33.620 --> 00:01:37.320
Jiki au kumsalimu mtu mwingine yeyote, kulingana na

00:01:37.360 --> 00:01:41.000
kilicho ndani ya sanduku la name. Tunaweza pia kutumia

00:01:41.040 --> 00:01:44.220
kitu kinachoitwa template literals (violezo vya string) kufanikisha

00:01:44.280 --> 00:01:48.790
jambo lile lile. Hilo ni neno jingine la kifahari na lenye kuchanganya bila sababu, ambalo

00:01:48.840 --> 00:01:53.920
linamaanisha kuingiza string ndani ya string nyingine. Kwa hiyo, badala

00:01:53.960 --> 00:01:56.950
ya kuongeza string pamoja, tunaweza kuwa na

00:01:57.120 --> 00:02:00.830
string au kiolezo kilicho na nafasi za string

00:02:00.900 --> 00:02:04.020
nyingine ndani yake. Sasa, ili kufanya hivi,

00:02:04.040 --> 00:02:09.800
tunatumia backticks badala ya alama za nukuu. Kama

00:02:09.880 --> 00:02:12.420
jina lake linavyosema, backtick ni alama inayoelekea nyuma, lakini

00:02:12.460 --> 00:02:15.080
inawezekana hujawahi kuitumia kabla, kwa hiyo

00:02:15.120 --> 00:02:17.100
unahitaji kupata kitufe sahihi kwenye

00:02:17.140 --> 00:02:20.730
kibodi yako. Tunazitumia kuunda

00:02:20.800 --> 00:02:24.150
kiolezo kinachoweza kuwa na string nyingine ndani yake. Na kisha,

00:02:24.220 --> 00:02:27.220
ili kuingiza string ndani ya kiolezo,

00:02:27.300 --> 00:02:30.540
tunatumia msimbo mwingine wa ajabu wenye alama ya dola na mabano yaliyopinda.

00:02:30.580 --> 00:02:33.160
Kwa mfano, ili kufikia kile kile cha

00:02:33.180 --> 00:02:36.200
"hello " + name tulichokiona hivi punde, tunaweza

00:02:36.420 --> 00:02:40.700
kutumia... tunaweza kuandika backtick, hello, alama ya dola,

00:02:40.860 --> 00:02:45.180
bano, name, bano, backtick. Hiyo inaonekana

00:02:45.220 --> 00:02:46.560
bora zaidi kuliko inavyosikika ninapoitamka.

00:02:47.800 --> 00:02:50.520
Na hiyo inafanya kitu kile kile

00:02:50.580 --> 00:02:53.320
kama kuongeza string pamoja. Lakini unapokuwa na

00:02:53.390 --> 00:02:56.120
string nyingi zinazohitaji kuunganishwa zote

00:02:56.160 --> 00:02:58.320
mahali pamoja, hii inaweza kuwa bora zaidi kwa kiasi kikubwa.

00:02:59.160 --> 00:03:00.049
Itakuchukua muda

00:03:00.100 --> 00:03:02.380
kidogo kuizoea sintaksia hii mahususi,

00:03:02.900 --> 00:03:05.420
lakini hakuna kitu kigumu sana kuhusu hiyo.

00:03:07.000 --> 00:03:09.140
Nimekupa mazoezi mawili sasa ya kujizoeza

00:03:09.180 --> 00:03:11.780
haya. La kwanza linatumia mtindo ule ule wa

00:03:11.840 --> 00:03:14.420
hello name tuliouona hivi punde. Unaweza

00:03:14.460 --> 00:03:17.060
kulifanya kwa kuongeza string au kwa violezo hivi,

00:03:18.100 --> 00:03:20.640
na nitaweka njia zote mbili kwenye maagizo kama

00:03:20.680 --> 00:03:23.880
ukumbusho. Zoezi la pili ni swali maarufu

00:03:24.100 --> 00:03:27.120
la usaili wa kazi. Kwa hiyo kujifunza hili kutakuacha

00:03:27.200 --> 00:03:29.760
ukiwa umejiandaa vizuri kwa usaili wowote wa kazi ujao.

00:03:30.620 --> 00:03:31.980
Bahati njema, na tutaonana

00:03:32.040 --> 00:03:32.380
hapa tena hivi karibuni.
